  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">The "Query Overdue Tasks" node's condition references sprk_duedate only; before/after recorded; a rescheduled task (due in future, final due past) is not selected; an overdue task (due past) is selected — proven live, test rows deleted.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The VisualHost due-date card and CalendarVisual never read sprk_finalduedate to decide what to show; tests fail on the old fallback.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">No other playbook node or reader changed; git grep for sprk_finalduedate shows only informational uses, listed in the PR body.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A PR against master is open with CI green.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

